Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 16:59:53 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix: report paste and drop edits with their own edit source

Paste and drop edits are applied as snippets through the bulk edit
service, which dropped the `reason` option, so text model listeners
saw them as plain 'snippet' edits.

- forward `reason` to `SnippetController2.apply` in bulk text edits
- pass a `cursor({ kind: 'paste' })` reason when applying paste edits
- add a `drop` edit source and use it for drop edits
- let `PostEditWidgetManager` take the edit reason to use when
  switching between paste/drop options
---
